So today... and yesterday, those of you who watched yesterday's stream probably know,

77
00:07:28,248 --> 00:07:32,648
あの、何じゃっけ、あのー
but, what was it, um...

78
00:07:33,948 --> 00:07:38,448
カクカクしてたじゃろう？わしがカクカクしてたじゃろう？
I was lagging, right? My avatar was stuttering, right?

79
00:07:38,748 --> 00:07:41,748
そう、なんか、あ、アソビまりたいの話になってる、後ろ
Yeah, wait, ah, the background says "Asobimaritai #1"!

80
00:07:41,748 --> 00:07:43,748
ちょ、ちょ、ちょ、タイトル…
Wait, wait, wait, the title...

81
