Tokyo Electric Power...

130
00:10:38,223 --> 00:10:39,923
うるさくない？ちょうどいい？
Not too loud? Just right?

131
00:10:40,823 --> 00:10:41,723
大きい？
Too loud?

132
00:10:43,223 --> 00:10:44,423
ちょっと大きい？
A bit too loud?

133
00:10:45,423 --> 00:10:46,523
ちょっと大きい
A bit too loud.

134
00:10:46,823 --> 00:10:48,223
BGM 2つ？
Two BGMs?

135
00:10:49,223 --> 00:10:50,823
はっ 消えた？
Huh? Did it cut out?

136
00:10:51,323 --> 00:10:52,823
BGM消えた？
Did the BGM stop?

137
00:10:53,623 --> 00:10:54,623
どうじゃ？
How about now?

138
00:10:55,723 --> 00:10:56,823
どうじゃ？
How is it?

139
00:10:59,623 --> 00:11:02,823
なんか東京電力なのは分かったから...
Well, I know it's Tokyo Electric Power Company, so...

140
00:11:03,723 --> 00:11:05,523
電話番号とか見るのじゃ
I'll check the phone number.

141
00:11:05,523 --> 00:11:06,823
042...

142
00:11:07,723 --> 00:11:08,923
042...

143
00:11:09,223 --> 00:11:10,423
042...

144
00:11:12,923 --> 00:11:14,123
ええと...
Umm...

145
00:11:15,823 --> 00:11:17,923
042どの辺じゃったかの？
Where was 042 around again?

146
00:11:18,923 --> 00:11:20,523
すごい山だね
It's so mountainous.

147
00:11:21,123 --> 00:11:23,023
すごい山の中なのじゃ
We're totally deep in the mountains.

148
00:11:23,823 --> 00:11:26,023
BGM下げてほしい？了解なのじゃ
You want the BGM lowered? Understood.

149
00:11:27,523 --> 00:11:28,623
どう？
How's that?

150
00:11:30,423 --> 00:11:31,923
下がってる？
Is it lower?

151
00:11:33,123 --> 00:11:34,823
BGM下がってる？
Is the BGM turned down?

152
00:11:38,723 --> 00:11:39,923
いい感じ？
Is it good?

153
00:11:41,723 --> 00:11:42,723
どうじゃ？
How is it?

154
00:11:42,723 --> 00:11:44,123
音量はいい感じ？
Is the volume okay?

155
00:11:45,423 --> 00:11:46,323
なんか...
Like...

156
00:11:47,523 --> 00:11:48,723
その...
um...

157
00:11:50,323 --> 00:11:53,323
市とかはまだ全然分かんなくて...
I still don't know the cities at all...

158
00:11:53,823 --> 00:11:54,823
よいしょ
Yoisho.

159
00:11:56,623 --> 00:11:57,623
あの...
